BUG-08: Cancel order and Change slot buttons remain enabled on already delivered orders
    Issue Type:Bug
    Severity:Medium
    Priority:P2 (High)
    Test Data Used: Buyer: buyer1, Order: WC-01007-1 (Status: delivered)
      Summary: 
              As Per BR-11 and BR-15, buyers can only cancel an order within 5 minutes of placing it (before shipment) and can only change the delivery slot before the order ships. However, on an already delivered order, both Cancel order and Change slot buttons still appear enabled on the UI and only show an expected error after the user clicks and submits them.
    Steps To Reproduce:
1. Log in as buyer1 (Test@123).
  2. Go to Orders and click View on a delivered order (WC-01007-1).
  3. Check the Cancel order and Change slot buttons and try clicking them.

    Expected Result:
Both of them should not be enable for delivered order.

  Actual Result:
Both of them are enable and giving expected error output after clicking them.



